@startuml C3_Generate_Operation_Plans_Logical_View
title C3 – Plan Generation (Logical Architecture)
left to right direction
hide empty members

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor Wheat
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor CornflowerBlue
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor White
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

rectangle "Angular SPA" as SPA {
  rectangle "Operation Plans Feature" as Feature
  rectangle "Shared Utilities" as Shared
}

rectangle "TodoApi Gateway" as Api {
  rectangle "OemProxyController" as Controller
  rectangle "OemClient" as Client
  rectangle "Identity Middleware" as Identity
}

cloud "OEM Planning Service" as OEM
cloud "VVN & Resource Catalogs" as Catalogs

Operator --> Feature : UI interactions (HTTPS)
Feature --> Shared : gather VVN/resource data
Feature --> Controller : POST preview/generate
Controller --> Identity : enforce authorisation
Controller --> Client : compose OEM calls
Client --> OEM : Run algorithms, persist data
Shared --> Catalogs : HTTP GET metadata
OEM --> Controller : Previews, stored plans, metadata
Controller --> Feature : JSON responses

@enduml
